<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-section-density="strict" data-present-i18n="strict">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title data-zh="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator" data-en="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator">Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;800&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/article.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/scrollbar.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/article-narration.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/article-diagram.css" />
  <style>
    .program-hero .hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 18ch;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .program-grid-three {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
    .engagement-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    .engagement-card .layer-list {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .engagement-card .quote-block {
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .engagement-card.next .quote-block {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    }
    .engagement-card.next .quote-block strong {
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .engagement-card.next .quote-block span {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }
    .evidence-note {
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .table-scroll {
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .table-scroll .simple-table {
      min-width: 860px;
    }
    /* Component: .generated-diagram
       Reading mode: bordered figure contains one locale-specific generated SVG and its editable source link.
       Presentation mode: figure becomes an unframed slide and keeps the active SVG within the safe viewport. */
    .generated-diagram {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .generated-diagram img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 76vh;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    html[lang="en"] .diagram-zh,
    html:not([lang="en"]) .diagram-en {
      display: none;
    }
    .diagram-caption {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--rhythm-inline);
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .diagram-caption a {
      color: var(--teal);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .generated-diagram.is-active img {
      max-height: calc(100vh - 240px);
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active {
      width: 100vw;
      margin-left: calc((100% - 100vw) / 2);
      margin-right: calc((100% - 100vw) / 2);
      padding-top: 0;
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-radius: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(4, 17, 31, 0.9) 0%, rgba(4, 17, 31, 0.68) 48%, rgba(4, 17, 31, 0.08) 100%),
        url("media/program-cover.png") center / cover no-repeat;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding-right: var(--present-side-gap, 80px);
      padding-left: var(--present-side-gap, 80px);
      align-items: center;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-copy {
      max-width: 980px;
      padding: 0;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 18ch;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5.35rem);
      line-height: 1.02;
      text-shadow: 0 10px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .eyebrow {
      color: #86FFF0;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-copy > p,
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-actions,
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-panel,
    .is-presentation-mode .program-hero.is-active .hero-metrics {
      display: none;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card {
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card h3 {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card > p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card .layer-list {
      gap: 5px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card .layer-list li {
      padding: 6px 8px;
    }
    .is-presentation-mode .engagement-card .quote-block {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .program-grid-three {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .program-hero .hero-copy h1 {
        max-width: 14ch;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 9vw, 3rem);
        line-height: 1.04;
      }
      .generated-diagram {
        padding: 8px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;
      }
      .generated-diagram img {
        width: 900px;
        max-width: none;
        max-height: none;
      }
      .diagram-caption {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="orb orb-a"></span>
      <span class="orb orb-b"></span>
      <span class="orb orb-c"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="site">
      <header class="hero program-hero" data-present-step data-present-surface="board" data-present-i18n-invariant="title" data-step-title="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator" data-step-title-en="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator" data-step-label="00 / 实施指南" data-step-label-en="00 / Implementation Guide">
        <div class="topbar load-in">
          <a class="home-link" href="../../" data-zh="←" data-en="←" aria-label="返回首页">←</a>
          <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-mark"></span>
            <span data-zh="Business AI Solution" data-en="Business AI Solution">Business AI Solution</span>
          </div>
          <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="页面章节导航" data-nav-pager>
            <a href="#challenge" data-zh="定位" data-en="Positioning">定位</a>
            <a href="#control" data-zh="控制模型" data-en="Control Model">控制模型</a>
            <a href="#align" data-zh="对齐" data-en="Align">对齐</a>
            <a href="#collect" data-zh="征集" data-en="Collect">征集</a>
            <a href="#prioritize" data-zh="优先级" data-en="Prioritize">优先级</a>
            <a href="#build" data-zh="构建" data-en="Build">构建</a>
            <a href="#adopt" data-zh="运营" data-en="Adopt">运营</a>
            <a href="#assets" data-zh="资产" data-en="Assets">资产</a>
            <a href="#references" data-zh="参考资料" data-en="References">参考资料</a>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-copy load-in">
            <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="实施指南 · Customer Enablement · Business Innovation" data-en="Implementation Guide · Customer Enablement · Business Innovation">实施指南 · Customer Enablement · Business Innovation</span>
            <h1 data-zh="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator" data-en="Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator">Agentic AI Innovation Accelerator</h1>
            <p data-zh="客户 Overview 之后的详细实施方案：用五个阶段、六道决策门和一套可复用资产，把业务场景推进到可验证试点与客户自运营。" data-en="The detailed implementation guide after the customer overview: five phases, six decision gates, and reusable assets move business scenarios into validated pilots and customer-owned operations.">客户 Overview 之后的详细实施方案：用五个阶段、六道决策门和一套可复用资产，把业务场景推进到可验证试点与客户自运营。</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="#control" data-zh="进入执行指南" data-en="Open the Operating Guide">进入执行指南</a>
              <a class="button button-secondary" href="#assets" data-zh="查看交付物" data-en="Review the Deliverables">查看交付物</a>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-note" data-zh="参考节奏：Week 0 Sponsor Charter · Week 8 CoE Handoff · Week 12 首次成效复盘" data-en="Illustrative cadence: Week 0 Sponsor Charter · Week 8 CoE Handoff · Week 12 first outcome review">参考节奏：Week 0 Sponsor Charter · Week 8 CoE Handoff · Week 12 首次成效复盘</p>
          </div>

          <aside class="hero-panel load-in">
            <span class="panel-label" data-zh="执行契约" data-en="Operating Contract">执行契约</span>
            <h2 data-zh="Program 负责启发、培养与加速，客户保留业务决策和运营责任。" data-en="The Program Inspires, Empowers, and Accelerates; the Customer Retains Business Decisions and Operating Ownership">Program 负责启发、培养与加速，客户保留业务决策和运营责任。</h2>
            <ul class="layer-list">
              <li><span class="layer-number">1</span><span data-zh="不是产品演示：用业务模式启发可实施场景" data-en="Not a product demo: use business patterns to inspire implementable scenarios">不是产品演示：用业务模式启发可实施场景</span></li>
              <li><span class="layer-number">2</span><span data-zh="不是培训课程：客户团队在真实场景中完成构建与验证" data-en="Not a training class: customer teams build and validate with real scenarios">不是培训课程：客户团队在真实场景中完成构建与验证</span></li>
              <li><span class="layer-number">3</span><span data-zh="不是代建项目：微软提供方法与教练，客户负责上线和运营" data-en="Not outsourced delivery: Microsoft provides the method and coaching; the customer owns release and operations">不是代建项目：微软提供方法与教练，客户负责上线和运营</span></li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-metrics load-in">
          <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-zh="优先场景" data-en="Priority Scenarios">优先场景</div><strong>3</strong><span data-zh="以客户真实工作为 Workshop 实验主线" data-en="Real customer work anchors the workshop labs">以客户真实工作为 Workshop 实验主线</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-zh="参与角色" data-en="Accountable Roles">参与角色</div><strong>4</strong><span data-zh="Sponsor · 微软 · 客户 IT · 业务团队" data-en="Sponsor · Microsoft · Customer IT · Business teams">Sponsor · 微软 · 客户 IT · 业务团队</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-zh="推进阶段" data-en="Program Phases">推进阶段</div><strong>5</strong><span data-zh="从对齐到客户运营与下一批场景" data-en="From alignment to customer operations and the next wave">从对齐到客户运营与下一批场景</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label" data-zh="决策门" data-en="Decision Gates">决策门</div><strong>6</strong><span data-zh="没有证据，不进入下一阶段" data-en="No progression without the required evidence">没有证据，不进入下一阶段</span></div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section id="challenge" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="01 / 前提与定位" data-en="01 / Premise and Positioning">01 / 前提与定位</p>
            <h2 data-zh="解决 AI 试点难以规模化的悖论，做业务加速器而非代建项目" data-en="A Business Accelerator to Solve the AI Pilot Paradox, Not an Outsourced Delivery">解决 AI 试点难以规模化的悖论，做业务加速器而非代建项目</h2>
            <p data-zh="企业级 AI 陷入了“投资激增但可衡量回报稀缺”的炼金术悖论。本计划不提供空泛的功能演示或理论培训，而是启发、赋能并加速客户建立受管治的自驱创新体系，剔除无效实验以保障投资价值。" data-en="Enterprise AI faces an Alchemist's Paradox: surging investments but scarce measurable returns. This program replaces generic functional demos and theory-based training with a governed motion that inspires, empowers, and accelerates customer-led innovation to prune invalid experiments and secure investment value.">企业级 AI 陷入了“投资激增但可衡量回报稀缺”的炼金术悖论。本计划不提供空泛的功能演示或理论培训，而是启发、赋能并加速客户建立受管治的自驱创新体系，剔除无效实验以保障投资价值。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="insight-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="计划解决的业务问题与定位边界" data-step-title-en="Business Problem and Program Positioning" data-step-label="01 / 挑战与定位" data-step-label-en="01 / Challenge &amp; Positioning">
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3 data-zh="业务难题：炼金术悖论" data-en="The Challenge: The Alchemist's Paradox">业务难题：炼金术悖论</h3><p data-zh="Deloitte 2025 年调查表明，85% 的受访高管增加了 AI 投资，但仅 6% 报告了可衡量回报。缺乏从零散实验到成规模应用的标准路径，导致活动不等于价值。[3]" data-en="In a Deloitte 2025 survey, 85% of executives increased AI investment, but only 6% reported measurable payback. Activity does not equal value; enterprises lack a governed path from scattered experiments to scaled adoption.[3]">Deloitte 2025 年调查表明，85% 的受访高管增加了 AI 投资，但仅 6% 报告了可衡量回报。缺乏从零散实验到成规模应用的标准路径，导致活动不等于价值。[3]</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3 data-zh="启发，而不是功能演示" data-en="Inspire, Not a Product Demo">启发，而不是功能演示</h3><p data-zh="不枯燥罗列 Copilot Studio 的功能菜单。通过引入能激发客户共鸣的 AI 业务模式，让具体的业务痛点先于技术方案进入讨论。" data-en="Avoid merely showcasing Copilot Studio features. By introducing AI application patterns that spark business resonance, specific business pains drive the conversation before technical solutions.">不枯燥罗列 Copilot Studio 的功能菜单。通过引入能激发客户共鸣的 AI 业务模式，让具体的业务痛点先于技术方案进入讨论。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3 data-zh="赋能，而不是课堂培训" data-en="Empower, Not a Training Class">赋能，而不是课堂培训</h3><p data-zh="跳出脱离实际的理论讲解。要求客户带入真实工作场景与业务数据，由业务与 IT 协作，亲自在现场动手构建出核心问题的解决方案原型。" data-en="Step away from abstract theory. Customers must bring real work scenarios and data, enabling their business and IT teams to collaborate and build functional solution prototypes hands-on.">跳出脱离实际的理论讲解。要求客户带入真实工作场景与业务数据，由业务与 IT 协作，亲自在现场动手构建出核心问题的解决方案原型。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><h3 data-zh="加速，而不是代建项目" data-en="Accelerate, Not a Project Delivery">加速，而不是代建项目</h3><p data-zh="微软作为教练提供技术与方法论支持，而非包揽所有开发实施。由客户自己掌握业务产出成果、负责内部发布并主导产品生命周期环境的持续运营。" data-en="Microsoft provides methodological and technical coaching rather than outsourced delivery. The customer owns the business outcomes, internal release process, and continuous lifecycle operations.">微软作为教练提供技术与方法论支持，而非包揽所有开发实施。由客户自己掌握业务产出成果、负责内部发布并主导产品生命周期环境的持续运营。</p></article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="control" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="02 / 控制模型与流程总览" data-en="02 / Control Model and Process">02 / 控制模型与流程总览</p>
            <h2 data-zh="五个阶段由六道决策门串联，每次推进都要留下证据和责任人" data-en="Five Phases Connect Through Six Decision Gates, Each with Evidence and an Accountable Owner">五个阶段由六道决策门串联，每次推进都要留下证据和责任人</h2>
            <p data-zh="客户 Overview 定义了 Discover &amp; Align、Inspire &amp; Collect、Prioritize Top 3、Build &amp; Learn、Adopt &amp; Scale 五阶段。本指南把它落实为 Sponsor Charter、IT Readiness Check、Use Case Lock、MVP Demo、Hardening Gate 和 CoE Handoff 六道决策门；没有规定证据，就不进入下一阶段。" data-en="The customer overview defines five phases: Discover &amp; Align, Inspire &amp; Collect, Prioritize Top 3, Build &amp; Learn, and Adopt &amp; Scale. This guide operationalizes them through six decision gates: Sponsor Charter, IT Readiness Check, Use Case Lock, MVP Demo, Hardening Gate, and CoE Handoff. Progress stops when required evidence is absent.">客户 Overview 定义了 Discover &amp; Align、Inspire &amp; Collect、Prioritize Top 3、Build &amp; Learn、Adopt &amp; Scale 五阶段。本指南把它落实为 Sponsor Charter、IT Readiness Check、Use Case Lock、MVP Demo、Hardening Gate 和 CoE Handoff 六道决策门；没有规定证据，就不进入下一阶段。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="comparison-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="从客户 Overview 到执行指南" data-step-title-en="From Customer Overview to Operating Guide" data-step-label="02 / 使用方式" data-step-label-en="02 / How to Use This Guide">
            <article class="comparison-card">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="客户 Overview" data-en="Customer Overview">客户 Overview</span>
              <h3 data-zh="解释为什么参与、Program 是什么、客户会经历什么" data-en="Explain Why to Participate, What the Program Is, and What the Customer Will Experience">解释为什么参与、Program 是什么、客户会经历什么</h3>
              <p data-zh="用于 sponsor 对齐和客户沟通，覆盖 Program 定位、五阶段旅程、风险控制、运营节奏与场景分层。它建立共同语言，不承担逐项执行说明。" data-en="Use it for sponsor alignment and customer communication. It covers program positioning, the five-phase journey, risk controls, operating cadence, and scenario tiers. It establishes shared language rather than step-by-step execution.">用于 sponsor 对齐和客户沟通，覆盖 Program 定位、五阶段旅程、风险控制、运营节奏与场景分层。它建立共同语言，不承担逐项执行说明。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="comparison-card next">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="本执行指南" data-en="This Operating Guide">本执行指南</span>
              <h3 data-zh="说明每阶段谁在何时填写什么、如何过门、失败后怎么办" data-en="Define Who Completes What, When Each Gate Passes, and What Happens After Failure">说明每阶段谁在何时填写什么、如何过门、失败后怎么办</h3>
              <p data-zh="用于 Program 团队、客户 IT、业务 owner 和 sponsor 共同推进。每个阶段都给出交付物、最低证据、批准人、复盘节奏和降级路径。" data-en="Use it jointly across the program team, Customer IT, business owners, and the sponsor. Every phase specifies deliverables, minimum evidence, approvers, review cadence, and fallback routes.">用于 Program 团队、客户 IT、业务 owner 和 sponsor 共同推进。每个阶段都给出交付物、最低证据、批准人、复盘节奏和降级路径。</p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="quote-block evidence-note" data-present-step data-step-title="Program 的证据原则" data-step-title-en="Program Evidence Principle" data-step-label="02 / 证据原则" data-step-label-en="02 / Evidence Principle">
            <strong data-zh="Program 承诺形成证据和做出决策，不承诺固定 ROI 或生产级交付。" data-en="The Program Commits to Evidence and Decisions, Not Fixed ROI or Production-Grade Delivery.">Program 承诺形成证据和做出决策，不承诺固定 ROI 或生产级交付。</strong>
            <span data-zh="Week 12 是首次成效复盘窗口，不是回报保证；Workshop 产出可测试 MVP，不等于已获生产批准。客户成效必须根据自身基线、运行成本、采用和风险共同判断。" data-en="Week 12 is the first outcome-review window, not a return guarantee. A workshop produces a testable MVP, not production approval. Customer outcomes must be judged against the customer's own baseline, operating cost, adoption, and risk.">Week 12 是首次成效复盘窗口，不是回报保证；Workshop 产出可测试 MVP，不等于已获生产批准。客户成效必须根据自身基线、运行成本、采用和风险共同判断。</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="align" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="02 / Discover &amp; Align" data-en="02 / Discover &amp; Align">02 / Discover &amp; Align</p>
            <h2 data-zh="Sponsor Charter 和 IT Readiness Check 必须在场景锁定前完成" data-en="Complete the Sponsor Charter and IT Readiness Check Before Locking Use Cases">Sponsor Charter 和 IT Readiness Check 必须在场景锁定前完成</h2>
            <p data-zh="启动阶段确定谁有权做决定、客户愿意投入什么、哪些数据和平台条件可用，以及何种证据足以继续。Sponsor 缺席或 IT 阻塞没有 owner 时，Program 不进入 Top 3 选择。" data-en="Initiation establishes decision authority, customer commitment, available data and platform conditions, and the evidence required to proceed. If the sponsor is absent or an IT blocker has no owner, the program does not advance to top-three selection.">启动阶段确定谁有权做决定、客户愿意投入什么、哪些数据和平台条件可用，以及何种证据足以继续。Sponsor 缺席或 IT 阻塞没有 owner 时，Program 不进入 Top 3 选择。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="insight-grid program-grid-three" data-present-step data-step-title="启动阶段的三项交付物" data-step-title-en="Three Initiation Deliverables" data-step-label="02 / 启动交付物" data-step-label-en="02 / Initiation Deliverables">
            <article class="insight-card">
              <span class="card-index">01</span>
              <h3 data-zh="Sponsor Charter" data-en="Sponsor Charter">Sponsor Charter</h3>
              <p data-zh="记录业务目标、范围、决策机制、参与部门、人员投入、风险接受、停止条件和 Week 12 首次成效复盘窗口，由具名 sponsor 批准。" data-en="Record business goals, scope, decision rights, participating functions, staffing, risk acceptance, stop conditions, and the Week 12 first outcome-review window; obtain named sponsor approval.">记录业务目标、范围、决策机制、参与部门、人员投入、风险接受、停止条件和 Week 12 首次成效复盘窗口，由具名 sponsor 批准。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="insight-card">
              <span class="card-index">02</span>
              <h3 data-zh="Stakeholder Map" data-en="Stakeholder Map">Stakeholder Map</h3>
              <p data-zh="明确 sponsor、客户协调人、客户 IT owner、业务 owner、SME、maker、最终用户和批准人，并为每项交付物只指定一个 owner。" data-en="Identify the sponsor, customer coordinator, Customer IT owner, business owners, SMEs, makers, end users, and approvers, assigning one owner to every deliverable.">明确 sponsor、客户协调人、客户 IT owner、业务 owner、SME、maker、最终用户和批准人，并为每项交付物只指定一个 owner。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="insight-card">
              <span class="card-index">03</span>
              <h3 data-zh="IT Readiness Check" data-en="IT Readiness Check">IT Readiness Check</h3>
              <p data-zh="核对环境、身份、许可和容量、数据、连接器、DLP、ALM、日志、发布与支持路径；每个缺口都要有 owner、日期和降级方案。" data-en="Check environments, identity, licensing and capacity, data, connectors, DLP, ALM, logs, release, and support. Every gap needs an owner, due date, and fallback.">核对环境、身份、许可和容量、数据、连接器、DLP、ALM、日志、发布与支持路径；每个缺口都要有 owner、日期和降级方案。</p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="subsection-accordion">
            <article class="subsection-item" data-accordion>
              <button class="subsection-toggle"><span data-zh="六道决策门的最低证据" data-en="Minimum Evidence for the Six Decision Gates">六道决策门的最低证据</span></button>
              <div class="subsection-content">
                <p data-zh="决策门只回答是否可以继续；阶段负责完成工作。每道门都要有证据、批准人和未通过时的处理路径。" data-en="A gate answers whether the program may continue; a phase performs the work. Every gate requires evidence, an approver, and a route when it fails.">决策门只回答是否可以继续；阶段负责完成工作。每道门都要有证据、批准人和未通过时的处理路径。</p>
                <div class="table-scroll"><table class="simple-table"><thead><tr><th data-zh="决策门" data-en="Gate">决策门</th><th data-zh="参考时间" data-en="Illustrative Timing">参考时间</th><th data-zh="最低证据" data-en="Minimum Evidence">最低证据</th><th data-zh="批准人" data-en="Approver">批准人</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                  <tr><td data-zh="Sponsor Charter" data-en="Sponsor Charter">Sponsor Charter</td><td data-zh="Week 0" data-en="Week 0">Week 0</td><td data-zh="业务目标、范围、资源、决策机制、停止条件与衡量窗口" data-en="Goals, scope, resources, decision model, stop conditions, and measurement window">业务目标、范围、资源、决策机制、停止条件与衡量窗口</td><td data-zh="客户 Sponsor" data-en="Customer Sponsor">客户 Sponsor</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="IT Readiness Check" data-en="IT Readiness Check">IT Readiness Check</td><td data-zh="征集并行开展" data-en="Parallel with Intake">征集并行开展</td><td data-zh="环境、身份、许可与容量、数据、DLP、ALM 和支持路径" data-en="Environments, identity, licensing and capacity, data, DLP, ALM, and support path">环境、身份、许可与容量、数据、DLP、ALM 和支持路径</td><td data-zh="客户 IT Owner" data-en="Customer IT Owner">客户 IT Owner</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="Use Case Lock" data-en="Use Case Lock">Use Case Lock</td><td data-zh="Week 2" data-en="Week 2">Week 2</td><td data-zh="Top 3、场景画布、RACI、基线、成功指标与实验边界" data-en="Top three, use-case canvases, RACI, baselines, success measures, and experiment boundaries">Top 3、场景画布、RACI、基线、成功指标与实验边界</td><td data-zh="Sponsor + 业务 Owner + 客户 IT" data-en="Sponsor + Business Owner + Customer IT">Sponsor + 业务 Owner + 客户 IT</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="MVP Demo" data-en="MVP Demo">MVP Demo</td><td data-zh="Week 4" data-en="Week 4">Week 4</td><td data-zh="关键路径、代表性测试结果、限制清单和待办" data-en="Critical path, representative test results, limitations, and backlog">关键路径、代表性测试结果、限制清单和待办</td><td data-zh="业务 Owner" data-en="Business Owner">业务 Owner</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="Hardening Gate" data-en="Hardening Gate">Hardening Gate</td><td data-zh="Week 6" data-en="Week 6">Week 6</td><td data-zh="安全、评估、监控、人工接管、回退、发布和支持准备" data-en="Security, evaluation, monitoring, human escalation, rollback, release, and support readiness">安全、评估、监控、人工接管、回退、发布和支持准备</td><td data-zh="客户 IT + 业务 Owner" data-en="Customer IT + Business Owner">客户 IT + 业务 Owner</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="CoE Handoff" data-en="CoE Handoff">CoE Handoff</td><td data-zh="Week 8" data-en="Week 8">Week 8</td><td data-zh="Owner、运行手册、支持分级、指标面板、资产位置与评审计划" data-en="Owner, runbook, support tiers, measures dashboard, asset locations, and review plan">Owner、运行手册、支持分级、指标面板、资产位置与评审计划</td><td data-zh="客户 IT / CoE" data-en="Customer IT / CoE">客户 IT / CoE</td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="collect" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="03 / Inspire &amp; Collect" data-en="03 / Inspire &amp; Collect">03 / Inspire &amp; Collect</p>
            <h2 data-zh="先用分层案例打开想象，再用统一表单把想法变成可评估场景" data-en="Use Tiered Examples to Expand Possibilities, Then a Common Intake to Create Assessable Scenarios">先用分层案例打开想象，再用统一表单把想法变成可评估场景</h2>
            <p data-zh="场景征集不是功能愿望清单。每个提交必须说明用户、当前流程、问题频次、涉及数据与系统、预期变化和业务 owner。三个 Tier 只用于控制启发范围和预估交付复杂度，不是产品 SKU 或成熟度阶梯。" data-en="Scenario intake is not a feature wish list. Every submission must state users, the current process, problem frequency, data and systems involved, expected change, and business owner. The three tiers control inspiration scope and delivery complexity; they are not product SKUs or a maturity ladder.">场景征集不是功能愿望清单。每个提交必须说明用户、当前流程、问题频次、涉及数据与系统、预期变化和业务 owner。三个 Tier 只用于控制启发范围和预估交付复杂度，不是产品 SKU 或成熟度阶梯。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="comparison-grid program-grid-three" data-present-step data-step-title="三层场景启发与征集边界" data-step-title-en="Three Scenario Inspiration and Intake Tiers" data-step-label="03 / 场景分层" data-step-label-en="03 / Scenario Tiers">
            <article class="comparison-card engagement-card">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="Tier 1 · Everyday Productivity" data-en="Tier 1 · Everyday Productivity">Tier 1 · Everyday Productivity</span>
              <h3 data-zh="高频、低复杂度、业务用户可自助" data-en="Frequent, Low-Complexity, and Business-User-Led">高频、低复杂度、业务用户可自助</h3>
              <p data-zh="适合邮件分流、发票或订单识别、外部数据收集等重复工作。以节省处理时间和减少手工步骤为目标，通常以天为单位形成原型。" data-en="Suitable for email routing, invoice or order recognition, and external data collection. Target handling-time reduction and fewer manual steps; prototypes are commonly measured in days.">适合邮件分流、发票或订单识别、外部数据收集等重复工作。以节省处理时间和减少手工步骤为目标，通常以天为单位形成原型。</p>
              <ul class="layer-list">
                <li><span class="layer-number">1</span><span data-zh="难度：低" data-en="Complexity: Low">难度：低</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">2</span><span data-zh="业务影响：个人或团队效率" data-en="Impact: Individual or team productivity">业务影响：个人或团队效率</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">3</span><span data-zh="目标受众：广泛业务用户" data-en="Audience: Broad business users">目标受众：广泛业务用户</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div class="quote-block"><strong data-zh="常见构建模式" data-en="Typical Build Pattern">常见构建模式</strong><span data-zh="Agent + 企业知识；根据场景选择 Copilot chat harness 或 standard harness。" data-en="Agent plus enterprise knowledge, using the Copilot chat harness or standard harness as the scenario requires.">Agent + 企业知识；根据场景选择 Copilot chat harness 或 standard harness。</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="comparison-card engagement-card next">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="Tier 2 · Process Innovation" data-en="Tier 2 · Process Innovation">Tier 2 · Process Innovation</span>
              <h3 data-zh="面向专业人员的多步任务与可复用流程" data-en="Multi-Step Specialist Tasks and Reusable Processes">面向专业人员的多步任务与可复用流程</h3>
              <p data-zh="适合文档审查、复杂文档生成和 AI 翻译等需要集成、领域判断与人工检查点的工作。通常需要客户 IT 参与，以周为单位构建和验证。" data-en="Suitable for document review, complex document generation, and AI translation requiring integration, domain judgment, and human checkpoints. Customer IT typically participates, with build and validation measured in weeks.">适合文档审查、复杂文档生成和 AI 翻译等需要集成、领域判断与人工检查点的工作。通常需要客户 IT 参与，以周为单位构建和验证。</p>
              <ul class="layer-list">
                <li><span class="layer-number">1</span><span data-zh="难度：中" data-en="Complexity: Medium">难度：中</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">2</span><span data-zh="业务影响：任务周期与质量" data-en="Impact: Task cycle time and quality">业务影响：任务周期与质量</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">3</span><span data-zh="目标受众：Power Users 与流程 owner" data-en="Audience: Power users and process owners">目标受众：Power Users 与流程 owner</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div class="quote-block"><strong data-zh="常见构建模式" data-en="Typical Build Pattern">常见构建模式</strong><span data-zh="GitHub Copilot harness Agent + Workflow；Workflow 组合原生 AI actions、agent handoff、逻辑和人工检查点。[1][2]" data-en="A GitHub Copilot harness agent plus a workflow that combines native AI actions, agent handoffs, logic, and human checkpoints.[1][2]">GitHub Copilot harness Agent + Workflow；Workflow 组合原生 AI actions、agent handoff、逻辑和人工检查点。[1][2]</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="comparison-card engagement-card">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="Tier 3 · Agentic Processes" data-en="Tier 3 · Agentic Processes">Tier 3 · Agentic Processes</span>
              <h3 data-zh="跨系统、持续运行、企业级影响" data-en="Cross-System, Continuous, Enterprise-Scale Impact">跨系统、持续运行、企业级影响</h3>
              <p data-zh="适合运营 Agent、业务系统 Agent 和销售或现场服务运营 Agent。需要安全、治理、可观测性、人工接管和跨团队运营设计，不适合作为单日 Workshop 的完整上线目标。" data-en="Suitable for operations agents, business-system agents, and sales or field-service operations agents. These require security, governance, observability, human escalation, and cross-functional operating design; they are not a full production target for a one-day workshop.">适合运营 Agent、业务系统 Agent 和销售或现场服务运营 Agent。需要安全、治理、可观测性、人工接管和跨团队运营设计，不适合作为单日 Workshop 的完整上线目标。</p>
              <ul class="layer-list">
                <li><span class="layer-number">1</span><span data-zh="难度：高" data-en="Complexity: High">难度：高</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">2</span><span data-zh="业务影响：跨团队流程结果" data-en="Impact: Cross-team process outcomes">业务影响：跨团队流程结果</span></li>
                <li><span class="layer-number">3</span><span data-zh="目标受众：业务 owner、IT 与运营团队" data-en="Audience: Business owners, IT, and operations">目标受众：业务 owner、IT 与运营团队</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div class="quote-block"><strong data-zh="常见构建模式" data-en="Typical Build Pattern">常见构建模式</strong><span data-zh="Agent + Workflow + Power Apps 配套任务体验 + 运营指标；Power Apps 是配套界面，不是 Copilot Studio 原生构建类型。[1][3]" data-en="Agent plus workflow plus a Power Apps companion task experience and operating measures. Power Apps provides the companion interface; it is not a native Copilot Studio build type.[1][3]">Agent + Workflow + Power Apps 配套任务体验 + 运营指标；Power Apps 是配套界面，不是 Copilot Studio 原生构建类型。[1][3]</span></div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="subsection-accordion">
            <article class="subsection-item" data-accordion>
              <button class="subsection-toggle"><span data-zh="场景征集表与 Harness 选择" data-en="Scenario Intake Fields and Harness Selection">场景征集表与 Harness 选择</span></button>
              <div class="subsection-content">
                <p data-zh="提交必须补齐用户、owner、当前流程、频次、输入输出、数据、系统、人工检查点和基线。Harness 是模型与构建对象之间的运行时，再根据工作特征选择 Copilot chat、standard 或 GitHub Copilot harness。[1]" data-en="Submissions must identify users, owner, current process, frequency, inputs and outputs, data, systems, human checkpoints, and baseline. A harness is the runtime between the model and what is built; select the Copilot chat, standard, or GitHub Copilot harness based on work characteristics.[1]">提交必须补齐用户、owner、当前流程、频次、输入输出、数据、系统、人工检查点和基线。Harness 是模型与构建对象之间的运行时，再根据工作特征选择 Copilot chat、standard 或 GitHub Copilot harness。[1]</p>
                <div class="table-scroll"><table class="simple-table"><thead><tr><th data-zh="官方 Harness" data-en="Official Harness">官方 Harness</th><th data-zh="适用工作" data-en="Best-Fit Work">适用工作</th><th data-zh="在计划中的常见位置" data-en="Typical Program Position">在计划中的常见位置</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                  <tr><td data-zh="Copilot chat harness" data-en="Copilot chat harness">Copilot chat harness</td><td data-zh="在 Microsoft 365 Copilot Chat 中连接企业知识" data-en="Connect enterprise knowledge to Microsoft 365 Copilot Chat">在 Microsoft 365 Copilot Chat 中连接企业知识</td><td data-zh="以 Chat 为主" data-en="Primarily Chat">以 Chat 为主</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="Standard harness" data-en="Standard harness">Standard harness</td><td data-zh="规则清楚、结构化、可重复的对话或 Agent flow" data-en="Rule-based, structured, repeatable conversations or agent flows">规则清楚、结构化、可重复的对话或 Agent flow</td><td data-zh="Chat 或确定性 Cowork" data-en="Chat or deterministic Cowork">Chat 或确定性 Cowork</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="GitHub Copilot harness" data-en="GitHub Copilot harness">GitHub Copilot harness</td><td data-zh="推理密集、多步骤、跨工具和文件的业务流程" data-en="Reasoning-heavy, multi-step business processes across tools and files">推理密集、多步骤、跨工具和文件的业务流程</td><td data-zh="Cowork 或 Worker" data-en="Cowork or Worker">Cowork 或 Worker</td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="prioritize" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="04 / Prioritize Top 3" data-en="04 / Prioritize Top 3">04 / Prioritize Top 3</p>
            <h2 data-zh="Use Case Lock 把三个候选想法变成有 owner、基线和固定边界的实验" data-en="Use Case Lock Turns Three Candidate Ideas into Owned, Baseline-Driven, Bounded Experiments">Use Case Lock 把三个候选想法变成有 owner、基线和固定边界的实验</h2>
            <p data-zh="选择会议不按热度或部门声量排序，也不要求每个 Tier 各选一个。微软主持评分，客户 IT 判断数据与运营条件，业务 owner 对基线和验收负责，sponsor 在依赖和资源透明后批准 Top 3。" data-en="The selection meeting does not rank by enthusiasm or departmental influence, nor does it require one scenario from each tier. Microsoft facilitates scoring, Customer IT evaluates data and operating conditions, business owners own baselines and acceptance, and the sponsor approves the top three after dependencies and resources are visible.">选择会议不按热度或部门声量排序，也不要求每个 Tier 各选一个。微软主持评分，客户 IT 判断数据与运营条件，业务 owner 对基线和验收负责，sponsor 在依赖和资源透明后批准 Top 3。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="table-scroll" data-present-step data-present-surface="unframed" data-step-title="Use Case Lock 的五项选择条件" data-step-title-en="Five Selection Conditions for Use Case Lock" data-step-label="04 / 场景锁定" data-step-label-en="04 / Use Case Lock">
            <table class="simple-table"><thead><tr><th data-zh="门槛" data-en="Gate">门槛</th><th data-zh="必须回答的问题" data-en="Required Answer">必须回答的问题</th><th data-zh="可接受证据" data-en="Acceptable Evidence">可接受证据</th><th data-zh="未通过时处理" data-en="If the Gate Fails">未通过时处理</th></tr></thead><tbody>
              <tr><td data-zh="业务价值" data-en="Business Value">业务价值</td><td data-zh="改善哪个周期、质量、容量或风险指标？" data-en="Which cycle-time, quality, capacity, or risk measure changes?">改善哪个周期、质量、容量或风险指标？</td><td data-zh="当前耗时、数量、错误或返工基线" data-en="Current time, volume, error, or rework baseline">当前耗时、数量、错误或返工基线</td><td data-zh="回到场景澄清" data-en="Return to scenario clarification">回到场景澄清</td></tr>
              <tr><td data-zh="业务责任" data-en="Business Ownership">业务责任</td><td data-zh="谁提供领域判断、验收并推动采用？" data-en="Who supplies domain judgment, accepts the result, and drives adoption?">谁提供领域判断、验收并推动采用？</td><td data-zh="具名 owner 与业务 SME" data-en="Named owner and business SME">具名 owner 与业务 SME</td><td data-zh="不进入三个优先场景" data-en="Do not prioritize">不进入三个优先场景</td></tr>
              <tr><td data-zh="数据与访问" data-en="Data and Access">数据与访问</td><td data-zh="Workshop 能否获得代表性样例和合法访问路径？" data-en="Can the workshop obtain representative examples and an approved access path?">Workshop 能否获得代表性样例和合法访问路径？</td><td data-zh="样例数据、知识源、连接器与账号" data-en="Sample data, knowledge source, connectors, and accounts">样例数据、知识源、连接器与账号</td><td data-zh="缩小范围或延后" data-en="Reduce scope or defer">缩小范围或延后</td></tr>
              <tr><td data-zh="Week 4 可验证" data-en="Testable by Week 4">Week 4 可验证</td><td data-zh="关键路径能否形成可测试 MVP？" data-en="Can the critical path become a testable MVP?">关键路径能否形成可测试 MVP？</td><td data-zh="明确输入、动作、输出和人工检查点" data-en="Defined inputs, actions, outputs, and human checkpoints">明确输入、动作、输出和人工检查点</td><td data-zh="拆分成更小实验" data-en="Split into a smaller experiment">拆分成更小实验</td></tr>
              <tr><td data-zh="运营可接续" data-en="Operable After the Workshop">运营可接续</td><td data-zh="谁处理权限、日志、异常、变更与发布？" data-en="Who handles access, logs, exceptions, change, and release?">谁处理权限、日志、异常、变更与发布？</td><td data-zh="客户 IT owner 与支持路径" data-en="Customer IT owner and support path">客户 IT owner 与支持路径</td><td data-zh="保留为学习样例，不进入试点" data-en="Keep as a learning example, not a pilot">保留为学习样例，不进入试点</td></tr>
            </tbody></table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="build" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="05 / Build &amp; Learn" data-en="05 / Build &amp; Learn">05 / Build &amp; Learn</p>
            <h2 data-zh="MVP Demo 证明关键路径，Hardening Gate 决定是否具备有限上线条件" data-en="The MVP Demo Proves the Critical Path; the Hardening Gate Decides Whether Limited Release Is Viable">MVP Demo 证明关键路径，Hardening Gate 决定是否具备有限上线条件</h2>
            <p data-zh="Workshop 或构建冲刺结束时得到的是可测试 MVP，不是生产承诺。业务团队先用代表性样例验收关键路径，客户 IT 再检查安全、评估、可观测性、ALM、容量、回退和支持。两道门都通过后，才可进入受控试点。" data-en="A workshop or build sprint produces a testable MVP, not a production promise. Business teams first validate the critical path with representative examples; Customer IT then reviews security, evaluation, observability, ALM, capacity, rollback, and support. A controlled pilot begins only after both gates pass.">Workshop 或构建冲刺结束时得到的是可测试 MVP，不是生产承诺。业务团队先用代表性样例验收关键路径，客户 IT 再检查安全、评估、可观测性、ALM、容量、回退和支持。两道门都通过后，才可进入受控试点。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="comparison-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="MVP Demo 与 Hardening Gate 的差异" data-step-title-en="How the MVP Demo Differs from the Hardening Gate" data-step-label="05 / 双重验证" data-step-label-en="05 / Dual Validation">
            <article class="comparison-card"><span class="comparison-label" data-zh="MVP Demo · Week 4" data-en="MVP Demo · Week 4">MVP Demo · Week 4</span><h3 data-zh="业务可用性证据" data-en="Business-Usefulness Evidence">业务可用性证据</h3><p data-zh="展示输入、动作、输出和人工检查点；用正常、边界、错误和敏感样例记录期望、实际结果与人工判断；同时公开限制、失败和下一轮待办。未通过时回到实验设计或停止。" data-en="Demonstrate inputs, actions, outputs, and human checkpoints. Record expectations, actual results, and human judgment across normal, boundary, error, and sensitive examples. Expose limitations, failures, and the next backlog. If the gate fails, return to experiment design or stop.">展示输入、动作、输出和人工检查点；用正常、边界、错误和敏感样例记录期望、实际结果与人工判断；同时公开限制、失败和下一轮待办。未通过时回到实验设计或停止。</p></article>
            <article class="comparison-card next"><span class="comparison-label" data-zh="Hardening Gate · Week 6" data-en="Hardening Gate · Week 6">Hardening Gate · Week 6</span><h3 data-zh="有限上线准备证据" data-en="Limited-Release Readiness Evidence">有限上线准备证据</h3><p data-zh="确认权限和数据合规、评估与监控、人工接管、回退、版本发布、容量监控和支持路径。未通过时继续加固，不得以演示成功替代上线批准。" data-en="Confirm compliant access and data, evaluation and monitoring, human escalation, rollback, versioned release, capacity monitoring, and support. If the gate fails, continue hardening; a successful demo does not substitute for release approval.">确认权限和数据合规、评估与监控、人工接管、回退、版本发布、容量监控和支持路径。未通过时继续加固，不得以演示成功替代上线批准。</p></article>
          </div>

          <div class="subsection-accordion">
            <article class="subsection-item" data-accordion>
              <button class="subsection-toggle"><span data-zh="构建周节奏与四方责任" data-en="Build-Week Cadence and Four-Party Accountability">构建周节奏与四方责任</span></button>
              <div class="subsection-content">
                <p data-zh="每周 Build Clinic 关闭技术阻塞，每周 Test Review 更新测试证据，decision log 持续记录决定、依据、owner 和待验证假设；每项结果只有一个明确 owner。" data-en="A weekly build clinic closes technical blockers, a weekly test review updates evidence, and the decision log records decisions, rationale, owners, and hypotheses to validate. Every outcome has one explicit owner.">每周 Build Clinic 关闭技术阻塞，每周 Test Review 更新测试证据，decision log 持续记录决定、依据、owner 和待验证假设；每项结果只有一个明确 owner。</p>
                <div class="table-scroll"><table class="simple-table"><thead><tr><th data-zh="角色" data-en="Role">角色</th><th data-zh="负责" data-en="Owns">负责</th><th data-zh="不负责" data-en="Does Not Own">不负责</th><th data-zh="核心决策" data-en="Core Decision">核心决策</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                  <tr><td data-zh="微软" data-en="Microsoft">微软</td><td data-zh="方法、场景启发、评分引导、产品架构、Workshop 教练与疑难排解" data-en="Method, scenario inspiration, scoring facilitation, product architecture, workshop coaching, and unblock support">方法、场景启发、评分引导、产品架构、Workshop 教练与疑难排解</td><td data-zh="客户内部优先级、业务验收和上线运营" data-en="Customer priorities, business acceptance, or production operations">客户内部优先级、业务验收和上线运营</td><td data-zh="建议构建模式与风险边界" data-en="Recommend the build pattern and risk boundary">建议构建模式与风险边界</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="客户 IT" data-en="Customer IT">客户 IT</td><td data-zh="Program 协调、环境、权限、连接器、平台标准、发布和支持路径" data-en="Program coordination, environments, access, connectors, platform standards, release, and support path">Program 协调、环境、权限、连接器、平台标准、发布和支持路径</td><td data-zh="代替业务定义价值或验收" data-en="Defining value or accepting outcomes for the business">代替业务定义价值或验收</td><td data-zh="平台 readiness 与运营可接续性" data-en="Platform readiness and operability">平台 readiness 与运营可接续性</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="业务团队" data-en="Business Teams">业务团队</td><td data-zh="当前流程、领域知识、真实样例、基线、验收、使用反馈与采用" data-en="Current process, domain knowledge, real examples, baseline, acceptance, feedback, and adoption">当前流程、领域知识、真实样例、基线、验收、使用反馈与采用</td><td data-zh="环境管理和平台级发布" data-en="Environment management or platform-level release">环境管理和平台级发布</td><td data-zh="场景是否达到业务验收标准" data-en="Whether the scenario meets business acceptance criteria">场景是否达到业务验收标准</td></tr>
                  <tr><td data-zh="客户 Sponsor" data-en="Customer Sponsor">客户 Sponsor</td><td data-zh="跨部门优先级、资源、冲突处理和规模化决策" data-en="Cross-functional priority, resources, conflict resolution, and scale decisions">跨部门优先级、资源、冲突处理和规模化决策</td><td data-zh="日常构建和测试" data-en="Day-to-day building or testing">日常构建和测试</td><td data-zh="选择三个场景；批准试点；决定规模化或停止" data-en="Select the three scenarios, approve pilots, and decide whether to scale or stop">选择三个场景；批准试点；决定规模化或停止</td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="adopt" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="06 / Adopt &amp; Scale" data-en="06 / Adopt &amp; Scale">06 / Adopt &amp; Scale</p>
            <h2 data-zh="CoE Handoff 把技术资产、运营责任和成效复盘一起交给客户" data-en="CoE Handoff Transfers Technical Assets, Operating Ownership, and Outcome Review Together">CoE Handoff 把技术资产、运营责任和成效复盘一起交给客户</h2>
            <p data-zh="Handoff 确认哪些场景获准有限上线、谁负责运行和支持、哪些风险被接受、指标在哪里查看，以及何时由 sponsor 决定迭代、扩展或停止。它不表示所有 MVP 已达到生产要求。" data-en="Handoff confirms which scenarios are approved for limited release, who operates and supports them, which risks are accepted, where measures are reviewed, and when the sponsor will decide whether to iterate, expand, or stop. It does not imply that every MVP is production-ready.">Handoff 确认哪些场景获准有限上线、谁负责运行和支持、哪些风险被接受、指标在哪里查看，以及何时由 sponsor 决定迭代、扩展或停止。它不表示所有 MVP 已达到生产要求。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="insight-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="客户接管后的四项运营机制" data-step-title-en="Four Operating Mechanisms After Customer Handoff" data-step-label="06 / 运营机制" data-step-label-en="06 / Operating Mechanisms">
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3 data-zh="每周 Office Hours" data-en="Weekly Office Hours">每周 Office Hours</h3><p data-zh="按原型待办处理产品使用、数据连接和设计问题；会议结论写回同一个场景 backlog。" data-en="Resolve product, data-connection, and design issues from the prototype backlog and write every decision back to the same scenario record.">按原型待办处理产品使用、数据连接和设计问题；会议结论写回同一个场景 backlog。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3 data-zh="业务使用与异常评审" data-en="Business Usage and Exception Review">业务使用与异常评审</h3><p data-zh="业务 owner 检查使用样例、完成率、错误、人工接管和基线变化，决定下一轮只解决一个最高优先问题。" data-en="The business owner reviews usage examples, completion, errors, human escalation, and baseline movement, then selects one highest-priority issue for the next iteration.">业务 owner 检查使用样例、完成率、错误、人工接管和基线变化，决定下一轮只解决一个最高优先问题。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3 data-zh="Champion Community" data-en="Champion Community">Champion Community</h3><p data-zh="客户 IT 维护 maker、模板、连接模式、提示、测试样例和复盘记录。内部 badge 只表示完成 Program 实践，不等同于微软官方认证。" data-en="Customer IT maintains makers, templates, connection patterns, prompts, test examples, and review records. Any internal badge only recognizes program completion and is not a Microsoft certification.">客户 IT 维护 maker、模板、连接模式、提示、测试样例和复盘记录。内部 badge 只表示完成 Program 实践，不等同于微软官方认证。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><h3 data-zh="季度 Sponsor Review" data-en="Quarterly Sponsor Review">季度 Sponsor Review</h3><p data-zh="比较业务效果、采用、全负担运行成本、风险和复用情况，决定迭代、扩展、补平台能力或停止，并选择下一批机会。" data-en="Compare business effect, adoption, fully burdened operating cost, risk, and reuse; decide whether to iterate, expand, strengthen platform capability, or stop; then select the next opportunities.">比较业务效果、采用、全负担运行成本、风险和复用情况，决定迭代、扩展、补平台能力或停止，并选择下一批机会。</p></article>
          </div>

          <div class="comparison-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="试点评分卡与扩展决策" data-step-title-en="Pilot Scorecard and Scale Decision" data-step-label="06 / 成效决策" data-step-label-en="06 / Outcome Decision">
            <article class="comparison-card">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="最低评分卡" data-en="Minimum Scorecard">最低评分卡</span>
              <h3 data-zh="比较试点与启动前基线" data-en="Compare the Pilot with the Pre-Program Baseline">比较试点与启动前基线</h3>
              <ul class="challenge-list">
                <li data-zh="任务周期或每次处理耗时" data-en="Task cycle time or handling time per case">任务周期或每次处理耗时</li>
                <li data-zh="一次通过率、错误率或返工率" data-en="First-pass rate, error rate, or rework rate">一次通过率、错误率或返工率</li>
                <li data-zh="使用人数、使用频次与完成率" data-en="Active users, frequency, and completion rate">使用人数、使用频次与完成率</li>
                <li data-zh="许可、容量、支持、评估与维护的全负担成本" data-en="Fully burdened licensing, capacity, support, evaluation, and maintenance cost">许可、容量、支持、评估与维护的全负担成本</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="comparison-card next">
              <span class="comparison-label" data-zh="决策规则" data-en="Decision Rule">决策规则</span>
              <h3 data-zh="只有业务改善与运营可承受同时成立才进入下一步" data-en="Advance Only When Business Improvement and Operability Both Hold">只有业务改善与运营可承受同时成立才进入下一步</h3>
              <p data-zh="指标改善但运营负担不可接受时，缩小范围或补平台能力；运营稳定但指标未改善时，回到流程和用户需求；证据不足时延长有限试点。只有证据支持且风险被明确接受，才扩大范围。" data-en="If measures improve but operating burden is unacceptable, reduce scope or strengthen platform capability. If operations are stable but measures do not improve, revisit the process and user need. If evidence is insufficient, extend the limited pilot. Expand only when evidence supports the decision and risks are explicitly accepted.">指标改善但运营负担不可接受时，缩小范围或补平台能力；运营稳定但指标未改善时，回到流程和用户需求；证据不足时延长有限试点。只有证据支持且风险被明确接受，才扩大范围。</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="assets" class="section" data-reveal>
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="07 / 可复用资产库" data-en="07 / Reusable Asset Library">07 / 可复用资产库</p>
            <h2 data-zh="每道决策门都对应一份权威资产，并由客户指定 owner 和存储位置" data-en="Every Decision Gate Maps to an Authoritative Asset with a Customer Owner and Storage Location">每道决策门都对应一份权威资产，并由客户指定 owner 和存储位置</h2>
            <p data-zh="模板统一输入，客户实例记录事实，decision log 保存选择依据，scorecard 追踪试点证据。每项资产必须有版本、owner、更新时间和唯一存储位置；邮件附件和个人副本不能作为权威版本。" data-en="Templates standardize inputs, customer instances record facts, the decision log preserves rationale, and scorecards track pilot evidence. Every asset needs a version, owner, update date, and single storage location; email attachments and personal copies are not authoritative.">模板统一输入，客户实例记录事实，decision log 保存选择依据，scorecard 追踪试点证据。每项资产必须有版本、owner、更新时间和唯一存储位置；邮件附件和个人副本不能作为权威版本。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="insight-grid" data-present-step data-step-title="Program 权威资产登记" data-step-title-en="Authoritative Program Asset Register" data-step-label="07 / 资产登记" data-step-label-en="07 / Asset Register">
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3 data-zh="启动与征集资产" data-en="Initiation and Intake Assets">启动与征集资产</h3><p data-zh="Sponsor Charter、Stakeholder Map、IT Readiness Check、Inspiration Deck、Intake Form 和 Scenario Backlog。由 sponsor、客户 IT 与客户协调人分别维护。" data-en="Sponsor Charter, stakeholder map, IT Readiness Check, inspiration deck, intake form, and scenario backlog, maintained by the sponsor, Customer IT, and customer coordinator.">Sponsor Charter、Stakeholder Map、IT Readiness Check、Inspiration Deck、Intake Form 和 Scenario Backlog。由 sponsor、客户 IT 与客户协调人分别维护。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3 data-zh="场景锁定资产" data-en="Use-Case-Lock Assets">场景锁定资产</h3><p data-zh="评分表、三份 Use Case Canvas、RACI、基线、成功指标、实验边界和 Decision Log。范围变化时必须重新批准。" data-en="Scoring sheet, three use-case canvases, RACI, baselines, success measures, experiment boundaries, and decision log. Scope changes require reapproval.">评分表、三份 Use Case Canvas、RACI、基线、成功指标、实验边界和 Decision Log。范围变化时必须重新批准。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3 data-zh="构建与验证资产" data-en="Build and Validation Assets">构建与验证资产</h3><p data-zh="Lab Plan、Test Pack、Demo Script、Evaluation Scorecard、限制清单和 Hardening Backlog。每次构建和测试后更新。" data-en="Lab plan, test pack, demo script, evaluation scorecard, limitation register, and hardening backlog, updated after every build and test cycle.">Lab Plan、Test Pack、Demo Script、Evaluation Scorecard、限制清单和 Hardening Backlog。每次构建和测试后更新。</p></article>
            <article class="insight-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><h3 data-zh="运营与采用资产" data-en="Operations and Adoption Assets">运营与采用资产</h3><p data-zh="Runbook、Support Model、Risk Register、Metrics Dashboard、Release Record、Champion Community 名单和季度评审记录。" data-en="Runbook, support model, risk register, measures dashboard, release record, champion-community roster, and quarterly review record.">Runbook、Support Model、Risk Register、Metrics Dashboard、Release Record、Champion Community 名单和季度评审记录。</p></article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="references" class="section" data-reveal data-density-exempt="references">
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker" data-zh="References" data-en="References">References</p>
            <h2 data-zh="Program 定义与产品术语来源" data-en="Sources for Program Definitions and Product Terminology">Program 定义与产品术语来源</h2>
            <p data-zh="五阶段、六道决策门和运营节奏来自 2026 年 8 月客户 Overview；产品术语以同期可访问的 Microsoft Learn 页面为准。Overview 中的行业统计用于说明背景，不构成本 Program 的回报承诺；客户成效必须按自身基线验证。" data-en="The five phases, six decision gates, and operating cadence follow the August 2026 customer overview. Product terminology follows Microsoft Learn pages accessible at the same time. Industry statistics in the overview provide context and do not promise program returns; customer outcomes must be validated against the customer's own baseline.">五阶段、六道决策门和运营节奏来自 2026 年 8 月客户 Overview；产品术语以同期可访问的 Microsoft Learn 页面为准。Overview 中的行业统计用于说明背景，不构成本 Program 的回报承诺；客户成效必须按自身基线验证。</p>
          </div>
          <ol class="bib-list">
